msgid "Include Blender workspace operations"
msgstr "包含 Blender 工作区操作"

msgid "Allow workspace help, inspection, modeling, previews and exports automatically. Project import and scene placement still require approval."
msgstr "自动执行工作区帮助、检查、建模、预览和导出。导入项目和放入场景仍需批准。"

msgid "Allow automatic Blender operations"
msgstr "允许自动执行 Blender 操作"

msgid "Orca can inspect, model, preview and export assets automatically in your connected dedicated Blender workspace in Work mode. Edits are validated and saved as immutable recovery revisions.\n\nProject imports and scene placement still require their exact approval. This permission covers only Orca's fixed workspace commands. It does not start Blender or authorize arbitrary code or other MCP servers.\n\nRemember for this project enables this scope in future Work conversations and editor restarts. Plan stays read-only. Click the green edit icon beside ORCA to revoke automation and clear the remembered defaults."
msgstr "在工作模式下，Orca 可在已连接的专用 Blender 工作区中自动检查、建模、预览和导出资源。修改会经过验证，并保存为不可变的恢复版本。\n\n导入项目和放入场景仍需逐项批准。此权限仅涵盖 Orca 的固定工作区命令，不会启动 Blender，也不授权任意代码或其他 MCP 服务器。\n\n勾选“为此项目记住”后，后续工作对话和编辑器重启可使用此权限。计划模式保持只读。点击 ORCA 旁的绿色编辑图标可撤销自动化并清除记住的默认设置。"

msgid "Automate dedicated workspace modeling, inspection, previews and exports after confirmation. Project import and scene placement still require review."
msgstr "确认后自动执行专用工作区的建模、检查、预览和导出。导入项目和放入场景仍需审阅。"

msgid "Review operations (default)"
msgstr "审阅操作（默认）"

msgid "Blender workspace operation"
msgstr "Blender 工作区操作"

msgid "Auto apply workspace…"
msgstr "自动应用工作区操作…"

msgid "Running automatically…"
msgstr "正在自动执行…"

msgid "Auto applied"
msgstr "已自动应用"

msgid "Blender operation completed"
msgstr "Blender 操作已完成"

msgid "Blender operation did not complete"
msgstr "Blender 操作未完成"

msgid "Frame"
msgstr "完整取景"

msgid "Reset"
msgstr "重置"

msgid "Expand"
msgstr "放大"

msgid "Blender 3D preview"
msgstr "Blender 3D 预览"

msgid "Drag to orbit · Shift-drag or middle-drag to pan · Scroll to zoom"
msgstr "拖动旋转 · Shift 拖动或中键拖动平移 · 滚轮缩放"

msgid "3D preview unavailable. The rendered image remains available."
msgstr "3D 预览不可用，仍可查看渲染图像。"

msgid "3D preview released to save memory. The rendered image remains available."
msgstr "已释放 3D 预览以节省内存，仍可查看渲染图像。"

msgid " Blender workspace Auto apply is enabled."
msgstr " 已启用 Blender 工作区自动应用。"

msgid " Blender workspace operations still require review."
msgstr " Blender 工作区操作仍需审阅。"

msgid "BLENDER ASSET STUDIO"
msgstr "BLENDER 资产工作室"

msgid "Model Studio region"
msgstr "Model Studio 地区"

msgid "Workspace ID"
msgstr "工作空间 ID"

msgid "From Model Studio's workspace API Host"
msgstr "来自 Model Studio 工作空间的 API Host"

msgid "Custom endpoint"
msgstr "自定义端点"

msgid "Singapore"
msgstr "新加坡"

msgid "US (Virginia)"
msgstr "美国（弗吉尼亚）"

msgid "China (Beijing)"
msgstr "中国（北京）"

msgid "China (Hong Kong)"
msgstr "中国（香港）"

msgid "Germany (Frankfurt)"
msgstr "德国（法兰克福）"

msgid "Japan (Tokyo)"
msgstr "日本（东京）"

msgid "Model Studio API Key"
msgstr "Model Studio API 密钥"

msgid "Anthropic API Key"
msgstr "Anthropic API 密钥"

msgid "Use a Model Studio API key from the same region. Workspace-specific endpoints are recommended. Qwen chat website access is separate."
msgstr "使用同一地区的 Model Studio API 密钥。建议使用工作空间专属端点。Qwen 网页聊天的访问权限与此独立。"

msgid "Use an Anthropic API key. API billing is separate from Claude subscriptions. Orca uses the native Messages API."
msgstr "使用 Anthropic API 密钥。API 计费与 Claude 订阅独立。Orca 使用原生 Messages API。"

msgid "Enter a workspace ID or paste its complete base URL."
msgstr "输入工作空间 ID，或粘贴其完整基础 URL。"

msgid "On and Off control thinking on supported Qwen models. Provider default follows the model's default. Workspace and custom profiles need a matching check after changes."
msgstr "开启和关闭可控制受支持 Qwen 模型的思考。提供商默认遵循模型的默认设置。工作空间和自定义配置修改后需要匹配的兼容性检查。"

msgid "Official regional endpoint."
msgstr "官方区域端点。"

msgid "Enter an API key to use Agent tools."
msgstr "输入 API 密钥以使用智能体工具。"

msgid "Agent tools ready for this supported official profile."
msgstr "此受支持的官方配置已可使用智能体工具。"

msgid "Agent tools are off for this official profile."
msgstr "此官方配置的智能体工具已关闭。"

msgid "Thinking options depend on the selected Claude model. Signed thinking is private and retained only during the active tool turn."
msgstr "思考选项取决于所选 Claude 模型。带签名的思考保持私密，仅在当前工具回合中保留。"

msgid "On"
msgstr "开启"

msgid "Off"
msgstr "关闭"

msgid "Create game assets in a dedicated Blender workspace. Setup uses Blender's built-in Python; no commands, JSON or separate Python installation are needed."
msgstr "在专用 Blender 工作区中创建游戏资产。使用 Blender 内置的 Python，无需输入命令、JSON 或另行安装 Python。"

msgid "Set up Blender"
msgstr "设置 Blender"

msgid "Choose Blender…"
msgstr "选择 Blender…"

msgid "Choose Blender"
msgstr "选择 Blender"

msgid "Connect asset workspace"
msgstr "连接资产工作区"

msgid "Disconnect workspace"
msgstr "断开工作区"

msgid "New asset workspace"
msgstr "新建资产工作区"

msgid "Open asset in Blender"
msgstr "在 Blender 中打开资产"

msgid "Attach asset texture…"
msgstr "附加资产纹理…"

msgid "Choose asset texture"
msgstr "选择资产纹理"

msgid "Restore previous asset revision"
msgstr "恢复上一资产版本"

msgid "Revert last asset import"
msgstr "撤销上次资产导入"

msgid "Attach preview to chat"
msgstr "将预览附加到聊天"

msgid "Blender workspace"
msgstr "Blender 工作区"

msgid "Start the selected Blender installation with Orca's shipped asset connector? It uses an isolated startup and writes only dedicated asset revisions. Your open Blender files are preserved."
msgstr "使用 Orca 随附的资产连接器启动所选 Blender？它使用独立启动环境，仅保存专用资产版本，并保留您已打开的 Blender 文件。"

msgid "Restore the previous asset revision as a new workspace revision? Project imports are unchanged."
msgstr "将上一资产版本恢复为新的工作区版本？项目中已导入的资产保持不变。"

msgid "Revert the last imported asset only if its project bytes and recovery checkpoint still match?"
msgstr "仅在项目文件与恢复检查点仍匹配时撤销上次导入的资产？"

msgid "Advanced MCP connections"
msgstr "高级 MCP 连接"

msgid "Review Blender workspace operation"
msgstr "审查 Blender 工作区操作"

msgid "Approve this exact operation in the dedicated asset workspace. Project imports have their own reviewed destination and recovery checkpoint."
msgstr "批准专用资产工作区中的此项确切操作。项目导入拥有单独审查的目标位置与恢复检查点。"

msgid "Apply operation"
msgstr "应用操作"

msgid "Allow operation"
msgstr "允许操作"

msgid "Applied in editor · Save pending"
msgstr "已在编辑器中应用 · 待保存"

msgid "Start from saved Blender file…"
msgstr "从已保存的 Blender 文件开始…"

msgid "Choose Blender template"
msgstr "选择 Blender 模板"

msgid "Technical review details"
msgstr "技术审查详情"

msgid "Use the selected saved Blender file as a trusted asset template? Blender loads a private copy with automatic scripts disabled. Linked libraries, embedded scripts and drivers are unsupported. The original file is preserved."
msgstr "将所选已保存的 Blender 文件用作可信资产模板？Blender 加载私有副本并禁用自动脚本。不支持链接库、内嵌脚本及驱动器。原始文件保持不变。"

msgid "Blender asset workspace"
msgstr "Blender 资产工作区"

msgid "Choose Blender to prepare the asset workspace."
msgstr "选择 Blender 以准备资产工作区。"

msgid "Connected to the Blender asset workspace."
msgstr "已连接 Blender 资产工作区。"

msgid "Asset workspace actions"
msgstr "资产工作区操作"

msgid "Get Blender"
msgstr "获取 Blender"

msgid "Extensions"
msgstr "扩展"

msgid "Available inspections"
msgstr "可用检查"

msgid "Connection needs attention"
msgstr "连接需要处理"

msgid "Connect local MCP servers for reviewed external inspection."
msgstr "连接本地 MCP 服务器，进行需审核的外部检查。"

msgid "EXTENSIONS"
msgstr "扩展"

msgid "MCP Connections"
msgstr "MCP 连接"

msgid "Connect local tools to Orca. This first release supports listed text resources and Blender scene/status inspection. Modeling, rigging and asset import need the next Blender workflow."
msgstr "将本地工具连接到 Orca。首版支持已列出的文本资源及 Blender 场景和状态检查。建模、绑定及资产导入将在后续 Blender 工作流中实现。"

msgid "Connection name"
msgstr "连接名称"

msgid "Executable (absolute path)"
msgstr "可执行文件（绝对路径）"

msgid "Arguments (JSON array)"
msgstr "参数（JSON 数组）"

msgid "Inspection profile"
msgstr "检查配置"

msgid "Listed text resources"
msgstr "已列出的文本资源"

msgid "Blender — Community"
msgstr "Blender — 社区版"

msgid "Blender Lab — Official"
msgstr "Blender Lab — 官方版"

msgid "Discovered tools are metadata. Only the listed operations can be requested."
msgstr "发现的工具仅为元数据。只能请求列出的操作。"

msgid "For Blender Lab, install its official MCP add-on and standalone server. Open Blender, start the add-on listener, and choose Blender Lab — Official. The executable above is the MCP server, not Blender."
msgstr "使用 Blender Lab 时，请安装官方 MCP 插件和独立服务器。打开 Blender，启动插件监听服务，并选择 Blender Lab — 官方版。上方的可执行文件是 MCP 服务器，而非 Blender。"

msgid "Blender inspection"
msgstr "Blender 检查"

msgid "Use a trusted, installed MCP stdio server. The executable runs with your user account's access. Orca does not install packages or start saved connections automatically. Keep credentials out of arguments."
msgstr "请使用已安装且可信的 MCP stdio 服务器。程序以您的用户账户权限运行。Orca 不会自动安装软件包或启动已保存的连接。请勿在参数中填写凭据。"

msgid "Save connection"
msgstr "保存连接"

msgid "Connect…"
msgstr "连接…"

msgid "Remove connection"
msgstr "移除连接"

msgid "Disconnected"
msgstr "未连接"

msgid "Blender setup"
msgstr "Blender 设置"

msgid "Install a compatible MCP bridge and its Blender add-on, then open Blender and enable the add-on connection. Choose the bridge executable and its arguments above. Only the supported inspection operations are offered to Orca."
msgstr "安装兼容的 MCP 桥接程序及其 Blender 插件，然后打开 Blender 并启用插件连接。在上方选择桥接程序及参数。Orca 只能使用受支持的检查操作。"

msgid "Connections are saved for this exact project on this computer. External reads require Work mode and an Allow read decision. Returned content is shared with the selected model. Cloud requires a server catalog advertising MCP inspection."
msgstr "连接仅保存用于本机上的此确切项目。外部读取需要工作模式及“允许读取”确认。返回内容会共享给所选模型。Cloud 需要服务器目录声明支持 MCP 检查。"

msgid "Connect MCP server?"
msgstr "连接 MCP 服务器？"

msgid "Start this local program with your user account's access? It can access files and the network. Only connect a server you trust. This approval starts the connection; external reads have separate review."
msgstr "以您的用户账户权限启动此本地程序？它可以访问文件和网络。请仅连接可信的服务器。此确认仅启动连接，外部读取会单独审核。"

msgid "New connection"
msgstr "新建连接"

msgid "Could not save. Check the name, absolute executable path and JSON argument array (up to four connections)."
msgstr "无法保存。请检查名称、可执行文件绝对路径及 JSON 参数数组（最多四个连接）。"

msgid "Save the configuration before connecting."
msgstr "请先保存配置再连接。"

msgid "Connected · %d tools · %d resources"
msgstr "已连接 · %d 个工具 · %d 个资源"

msgid "Connecting…"
msgstr "正在连接…"

msgid "Allow external MCP read?"
msgstr "允许外部 MCP 读取？"

msgid "Send this inspection request to the connected server and share its returned text with the selected model?"
msgstr "将此检查请求发送给已连接的服务器，并将返回的文本共享给所选模型？"

msgid "Allow read"
msgstr "允许读取"

msgid "MCP read finished"
msgstr "MCP 读取已完成"

msgid "MCP read did not complete"
msgstr "MCP 读取未完成"

msgid "Inspect MCP connection"
msgstr "检查 MCP 连接"

msgid "If Orca has been useful to you, a GitHub star or an honest Godot Asset Library review would help other Godot developers discover the project. Thanks for supporting Orca!"
msgstr "如果 Orca 对你有所帮助，在 GitHub 上点个 Star，或在 Godot 资源库留下真实的评价，可以帮助其他 Godot 开发者发现这个项目。感谢你支持 Orca！"

msgid "Star on GitHub"
msgstr "GitHub 点 Star"

msgid "Resume remaining work"
msgstr "继续未完成的任务"

msgid "Apply in editor"
msgstr "在编辑器中应用"

msgid "Validated the live native transform and saved instance provenance without loading scenes or scripts."
msgstr "已验证当前原生变换及已保存的实例来源，未加载场景或脚本。"

msgid "\nBaseline  Current editor state, including unsaved edits. Earlier edits are preserved; consecutive transforms do not require saving."
msgstr "\n基准  当前编辑器状态，包括未保存的修改。保留已有修改；连续变换无需先保存。"

msgid "Revert rechecks the reviewed editor state and Undo history."
msgstr "还原前会重新检查已审阅的编辑器状态和撤销历史。"

msgid "Revert in editor"
msgstr "在编辑器中还原"

msgid "APPLIED IN EDITOR · SAVE PENDING"
msgstr "已在编辑器中应用 · 待保存"

msgid "SAVED · NOT VERIFIED"
msgstr "已保存 · 未验证"

msgid "SAVE OBSERVED · NOT VERIFIED"
msgstr "已观察到保存 · 未验证"

msgid "UNDONE IN EDITOR"
msgstr "已在编辑器中撤销"

msgid "REVERTED IN EDITOR · SAVE PENDING"
msgstr "已在编辑器中还原 · 待保存"

msgid "EDITOR STATE CHANGED"
msgstr "编辑器状态已变化"

msgid "\n\nKeeps the scene open and preserves normal Godot Undo. Applies in the editor only; save the scene before running it. Script trust also covers live attachment, property restoration and revalidation."
msgstr "\n\n保持场景打开，并保留 Godot 的正常撤销历史。仅在编辑器中应用；运行前请保存场景。脚本信任授权还涵盖编辑器中的脚本挂载、属性恢复和重新验证。"

msgid "Continue the unfinished tasks in the current checklist. Re-inspect the current project state before acting. Do not repeat completed actions. Reassess blocked tasks and use the current mode and normal edit permissions."
msgstr "继续当前任务清单中未完成的任务。操作前重新检查项目的当前状态，不要重复已完成的操作。重新评估受阻的任务，并遵循当前模式和正常的编辑权限。"

msgid "Finding Orca useful?"
msgstr "Orca 对你有帮助吗？"

msgid "A GitHub star or an honest Godot Asset Library review helps other Godot developers discover the project. Thanks for supporting Orca!"
msgstr "在 GitHub 上点个 Star，或在 Godot 资源库留下真实的评价，可以帮助其他 Godot 开发者发现这个项目。感谢你支持 Orca！"

msgid "Dismiss support reminder"
msgstr "关闭支持提醒"

msgid "Leave a review"
msgstr "留下评价"

msgid "Not now"
msgstr "暂时不用"

msgid "Don't ask again"
msgstr "不再提醒"

msgid "Open Orca's GitHub repository in your browser"
msgstr "在浏览器中打开 Orca 的 GitHub 仓库"

msgid "Open Orca's Godot Asset Library page in your browser"
msgstr "在浏览器中打开 Orca 的 Godot 资源库页面"

msgid "Settings"
msgstr "设置"

msgid "Language"
msgstr "语言"

msgid "Done"
msgstr "完成"

msgid "GENERAL SETTINGS"
msgstr "常规设置"

msgid "Changes Orca's interface only. Replies follow your message language, using this language when unclear."
msgstr "仅更改 Orca 的界面语言。回复使用您消息的语言；无法确定时使用此语言。"

msgid "Provider"
msgstr "提供商"

msgid "System"
msgstr "系统"

msgid "Account"
msgstr "账户"

msgid "About"
msgstr "关于"

msgid "API CONFIGURATION"
msgstr "API 配置"

msgid "API Provider"
msgstr "API 提供商"

msgid "API Key"
msgstr "API 密钥"

msgid "Optional API Key"
msgstr "API 密钥（可选）"

msgid "Enter API key"
msgstr "输入 API 密钥"

msgid "Optional for local servers"
msgstr "本地服务器可不填写"

msgid "Show"
msgstr "显示"

msgid "Hide"
msgstr "隐藏"

msgid "Get an API key"
msgstr "获取 API 密钥"

msgid "Stored in Godot Editor Settings and used only for requests to the selected provider."
msgstr "保存在 Godot 编辑器设置中，仅用于向所选提供商发送请求。"

msgid "Base URL"
msgstr "基础 URL"

msgid "Responses (reasoning + tools)"
msgstr "Responses（推理与工具）"

msgid "Reasoning Continuation"
msgstr "推理续接"

msgid "Standard"
msgstr "标准"

msgid "DeepSeek reasoning"
msgstr "DeepSeek 推理"

msgid "For Azure DeepSeek deployments, preserve private reasoning through Chat or Responses tool follow-ups and remove one leaked leading </think> delimiter. Works with custom deployment names."
msgstr "用于 Azure DeepSeek 部署：在 Chat 或 Responses 工具续接中保留私有推理，并移除开头泄漏的一个 </think> 分隔符。支持自定义部署名称。"

msgid "Model"
msgstr "模型"

msgid "Search available models..."
msgstr "搜索可用模型…"

msgid "Refresh"
msgstr "刷新"

msgid "Model ID"
msgstr "模型 ID"

msgid "Exact deployment name"
msgstr "准确的部署名称"

msgid "Enable unconfirmed image input"
msgstr "启用尚未确认的图像输入"

msgid "Use only if this exact endpoint and model accept image_url content. This does not enable Agent tools or verify vision quality."
msgstr "仅当此端点和模型确实支持 image_url 内容时使用。此选项不会启用智能体工具，也不验证视觉识别质量。"

msgid "Reasoning Effort"
msgstr "推理强度"

msgid "Provider default"
msgstr "提供商默认值"

msgid "None"
msgstr "无"

msgid "Minimal"
msgstr "最低"

msgid "Low"
msgstr "低"

msgid "Medium"
msgstr "中"

msgid "High"
msgstr "高"

msgid "Xhigh"
msgstr "极高"

msgid "Max"
msgstr "最高"

msgid "Higher effort can improve difficult planning and debugging, but may use more tokens."
msgstr "更高的推理强度有助于复杂规划和调试，但可能消耗更多令牌。"

msgid "Supported levels depend on your deployment. Provider default does not disable reasoning. For GPT reasoning with tools, prefer Responses; use None on Chat only if the deployment supports it."
msgstr "支持的强度取决于您的部署。提供商默认值不会关闭推理。GPT 推理与工具配合时优先使用 Responses；仅在部署支持时，才可在 Chat 中选择“无”。"

msgid "Use the resource's /openai/v1 base URL and exact deployment name. Responses supports reasoning with Orca function tools; requests use store=false. Select DeepSeek reasoning continuation for DeepSeek deployments."
msgstr "使用资源的 /openai/v1 基础 URL 和准确的部署名称。Responses 支持推理与 Orca 函数工具；请求使用 store=false。DeepSeek 部署请选择 DeepSeek 推理续接。"

msgid "For GPT reasoning with tools, prefer Responses. Chat without reasoning requires a deployment that supports None. Select DeepSeek reasoning continuation for DeepSeek deployments."
msgstr "GPT 推理与工具配合时优先使用 Responses。Chat 关闭推理需要部署支持“无”。DeepSeek 部署请选择 DeepSeek 推理续接。"

msgid "Request Timeouts"
msgstr "请求超时"

msgid "Use custom timeouts"
msgstr "使用自定义超时"

msgid "Override Orca's built-in response waits for this provider. Turning this off preserves your custom values."
msgstr "覆盖 Orca 为此提供商设置的默认响应等待时间。关闭后保留您的自定义值。"

msgid "Using Orca's default timeouts.\nHeaders: 30 s · Inactivity: 60 s"
msgstr "使用 Orca 默认超时。\n响应头：30 秒 · 无活动：60 秒"

msgid "Original timing: 30 seconds to connect, 30 seconds for response headers, 60 seconds without body data, and 45 seconds for an Agent compatibility check. Each full request is capped at 10 minutes."
msgstr "默认时间：连接 30 秒、响应头 30 秒、响应体无数据 60 秒、智能体兼容性检查 45 秒。每个完整请求最长 10 分钟。"

msgid "Response start"
msgstr "响应开始"

msgid "Stream inactivity"
msgstr "流式传输无活动"

msgid "Maximum wait for headers and initial response data, including model loading. Accepts 10–600 seconds."
msgstr "等待响应头和初始响应数据的最长时间，包含模型加载时间。允许 10–600 秒。"

msgid "Maximum pause after response data begins. Reasoning and keep-alive bytes count as activity. Accepts 10–600 seconds."
msgstr "收到响应数据后允许的最长暂停时间。推理和保活数据均视为活动。允许 10–600 秒。"

msgid "Allow extra time for model loading and slow generation."
msgstr "为模型加载和较慢的生成留出更多时间。"

msgid "Control how long Orca waits for this provider."
msgstr "设置 Orca 等待此提供商的时间。"

msgid "Saved per provider · 10–600 s\n10-minute limit · Stop available"
msgstr "按提供商保存 · 10–600 秒\n最长 10 分钟 · 可随时停止"

msgid "10-minute request limit.\nStop remains available."
msgstr "请求最长 10 分钟。\n仍可随时停止。"

msgid "Agent Compatibility"
msgstr "智能体兼容性"

msgid "Test & Enable Agent tools"
msgstr "测试并启用智能体工具"

msgid "Run the project-free compatibility check and enable Agent tools for this exact profile only if it passes."
